ERC will hold the Presidency and lead the government negotiations. Its opening institutional proposal gives the CUP the Speaker of the House before ERC presents us with its cabinet offer.

- @parlament_coalition_erc_cup_phase_cup_player_erc_led: Accept [+ speaker +] as Speaker

